{"unit_id":"wtksana__dsh-font-plugin#card-zh","repo":"wtksana/dsh-font-plugin","commit":"cbfe27308883c5901c217af84c108b113dba9496","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-font-plugin 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的字体与界面设置插件，在设置页面提供可展开的插件配置卡，并通过主端注册 dsh-font 设置空间、浏览器端读取配置并生成 CSS。用户可以分别调整界面正文及 Markdown 的字体栈、代码字体栈，并选择沿用主题默认或开启、关闭字体连字；保存后配置写入 DSH 设置并即时应用，也可重置字段或放弃未保存修改。它适合希望在 Web 使用 DSH 时统一阅读与代码显示字体、按个人系统字体改善中文或代码可读性的用户。无需 API Key 或额外外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:18-29","lib/client.js:384-435","lib/client.js:442-477"]}
{"unit_id":"wtksana__dsh-font-plugin#card-en","repo":"wtksana/dsh-font-plugin","commit":"cbfe27308883c5901c217af84c108b113dba9496","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-font-plugin adds font controls to DSH Web through a settings card. Choose separate font stacks for interface text and code, and set ligatures to the theme default, on, or off. Saving applies and persists changes; custom values can be reset or discarded. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:18-29","lib/client.js:384-435","lib/client.js:442-477"]}
